      en: ["The highest summit, Virovi, stands at 1,284 meters above sea level.", "The mountain is primarily composed of gneiss and crystalline schists.", "It served as a major base for Macedonian and Serbian partisans in WWII.", "The historic Prohor Pčinjski Monastery is located on its southern slopes.", "The second session of ASNOM took place here on August 2, 1944.", "The area is a protected natural habitat for several endangered eagle species."],
